{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Phrasing, man!": "",
  "But sorry.\nI really don't have much for you today.": "",
  "But I really don't have much\nfor you today. Sorry.": "",
  "Say what? You telling me\nI bought you a drink for nothing?": "",
  "Nothing!? I bought you a drink\nfor nothin' then?": "",
  "What, are times too tough\nto buy a round?": "",
  "Come on, that's a low blow.": "",
  "Here, lemme at least repay\nyou for the booze.": "",
  "Fine...\nI'll give you a drink's worth of intel.": "",
  "Did you know Hamura's in hiding?\nHe's been outta the office ever since last night.": "",
  "So Hamura's been in hiding since last night.\nMaybe you heard? Hasn't been seen in the office.": "",
  "Not even the cops can find the guy.": "",
  "...Yeah, Higashi told us as much, actually.": "",
  "Higashi already gave us that.": "",
  "You charging us for this old news?\nI'm starting to wonder here...": "",
  "Is that all a drink buys these days?\nAyabe, you're price gouging us.": "",
  "Okay, okay. Fine.": "",
  "I get it, guys...": "",
  "You want answers, go ahead and ask.\nEverything's on the house for tonight.": "",
  "Whatever you wanna know, just ask.\nIt's on the house this time.": "",
  "I'd rather talk business\nthan sit here in silence anyway.": "",
  "Sure beats the three of us\nsitting here bored and quiet.": "",
  "Sounds good to me.\nLemme think...": "",
  "Now there's a bargain.\nLet's see...": "",
  "Why are the Kyorei in Kamurocho to begin with?\nWhat's a Kansai group doing this far from home?": "",
  "I've been wondering. Why are the Kyorei\nin Kamurocho at all? They're Kansai-based.": "",
  "'Cause they wanted turf in Tokyo, duh.": "",
  "Easy. 'Cause they wanted turf in Tokyo.": "",
  "Even if it meant war with the Tojo?": "",
  "Even if it meant war\nwith the Tojo Clan?": "",
  "They couldn't have the numbers for that.": "",
  "They don't have the numbers for that.": "",
  "True. Compared to the Tojo's 25,000...\nThe Kyorei have a meager 1,000 at most.": "",
  "True. Compared to the Tojo's 25,000,\nthe Kyorei have a meager 1,000 at most.": "",
  "Plus Kamurocho's not exactly\ntheir home turf.": "",
  "Plus Kamurocho's not exactly\ntheir home turf. Not even close.": "",
  "By that logic,\nthey don't stand a chance.": "",
  "They shouldn't stand a chance.": "",
  " And yet they've been here almost two years now.\nCrazy when you think about it.": "",
  "Yeah. And somehow the Kyorei have still been\nin Kamurocho for about two years now.": "",
  "Even the cops put money on the Tojo Clan\ncrushing them into dust.": "",
  "Everyone figured the Tojo would crush them.\nEven us cops were counting on it.": "",
  "So what's the hold up then?": "",
  "So, why didn't that happen?": "",
  "The Kyorei has the backing of the Kajihira Group.\nIn other words, a lot of fucking money.": "",
  "Kajihira... Isn't he a construction bigwig?": "",
  "Kajihira? Construction company, right?": "",
  "Yup. And one of his subsidiaries\nis the perfect Kyorei cover.": "",
  "Yup. And they've got a subsidiary\naround here. The perfect Kyorei front.": "",
  "I suppose you'd know\nit better as KJ Art.": "",
  "You might know it as KJ Art.": "",
  "Yeah, we're familiar.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Makes sense. They'd never have made inroads in Kamurocho\nwithout some big time financial backing.)</color>": "",
  "What does Kajihira have to do with the Kyorei?\nWhy is he funding yakuza?": "",
  "What does Kajihira have to do with the Kyorei?\nWhat does he get out of funding yakuza?": "",
  "Probably so he can expand east out of Kansai.\nThe real money's out here anyway.": "",
  "Tokyo's valuable territory for expansion.\nNot for the Kyorei Clan. For Kajihira.": "",
  "From what I hear, he's got some big\nredevelopment plans for Tokyo.": "",
  "I hear he's got some big\nredevelopment plans for Tokyo.": "",
  "What kinda plans are we talking?": "",
  "Redevelopment? What kind?": "",
  "Not a clue. But if they're comin' from Kansai\nto do it, shit's gotta be important.": "",
  "And there's always dirty work\nwith those kinda jobs, y'know?": "",
  "And... those kind of projects bring\na lot of dirty work with them, huh?": "",
  "Like what?": "",
  "Evictions. Land sharks.\nLaying the political groundwork.": "",
  "Evictions, land sharks...\nPolitical groundwork, you know?": "",
  "The Kyorei's handling all that shit for Kajihira.\nLeast that's the word on the street.": "",
  "Kajihira's leaving all that shit to the Kyorei.\nLeast that's the rumor.": "",
  "Yeah, thanks. These rumors of yours\nare gonna do us a ton of good.": "",
  "Well, rumor or not...\nThat was a helluva tip. Thanks a lot.": "",
  "Well what I know for sure is that the\nKajihira CEO's been up in Tokyo a lot lately.": "",
  "The chairman of Kajihira's been coming to\nTokyo for a while. That much I know.": "",
  "Schmoozing with politicians, government officials.\nEven Kazami, the head of the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "Schmoozing with politicians, government officials.\nEven Minister Kazami, head of the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "Why would a construction guy be talking to someone\nfrom the Health Ministry? What's the connection?": "",
  "A construction guy kissing that kind of ass?\nWhat's he trying to accomplish?": "",
  "Beats me. Point is, the Kyorei\naren't here just for yakuza shit.": "",
  "Beats me. But the Kyorei aren't just here\nfor yakuza shit. That's all I'm trying to say.": "",
  "It's way more complicated than that.": "",
  "It's way more complicated\nthan that.": "",
  "How are things in the\nMatsugane Family?": "",
  "Well, you already know\nabout the shooting.": "",
  "Their hands are tied\nwhile the cops are running the show.": "",
  "Their hands are tied\nwhile the cops run the show.": "",
  "So, yeah.\nThey've been pretty quiet.": "",
  "So yeah, they've been pretty quiet.": "",
  "How's Kamurocho seemed to you lately?": "",
  "As far as you can tell,\nhow's Kamurocho been in general?": "",
  "Tense. And that shooting\nonly made things worse.": "",
  "After last night,\nthings have gotten real tense.": "",
  "Nobody knows when the next fight'll break out.\nOr where a stray bullet might end up.": "",
  "Nobody knows when there'll be another fight\nor another stray bullet.": "",
  "Right. And our killer's only gone for yakuza so far,\nbut he could target anyone next.": "",
  "Right. The Mole's only gone for yakuza so far,\nbut he could target anyone next.": "",
  "Gunfights, a murderer on the loose...\nThis city's a mess.": "",
  "We've got gunfights, a murderer on the loose...\nThis city's a mess.": "",
  "Heh, you got that right.\nBy the way...": "",
  "Heh. Ah, by the way...": "",
  "Hamura might've walked, but the cops're still\npretty fixated on this Mole case.": "",
  "That \"Mole\" nickname you cooked up?\nMade it into the police casefiles. ": "",
  "Even the public's wondering\nwho'll be next.": "",
  "Even the public's picking it up.": "",
  "Just wondering... How does it feel\nwhen people call you a dirty cop?": "",
  "Not to make a thing of it, but... How does it\nfeel when people call you a dirty cop?": "",
  "Eh, anyone who knows that side of me\nain't exactly a saint either, y'know?": "",
  "Way I see it, anyone who knows that side of me\nain't exactly a saint either, y'know?": "",
  "...I guess not.": "",
  "That's the pot calling the kettle black.\nOr the kettle calling the pot black. Whatever.": "",
  "So if they wanna call me a bad guy,\nwho are they to talk?": "",
  "Yeah, guess so.": "",
  "Ha, I'll give you that.": "",
  "You good, Tak?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm used to dealing\nwith assholes like that.": "",
  "Yeah. I'm used to dealing with\nassholes like that.": "",
  "What was Kuroiwa doin' there anyway?": "",
  "I bet he knows about\nAyabe's little side gig.": "",
  "If I had to guess, he knows\nabout Ayabe's little side gig.": "",
  "Probably came to keep him\nfrom chirping too much.": "",
  "So, probably came to keep him\nfrom chirping too much.": "",
  "Or maybe he wanted to keep\nan eye on us.": "",
  "Either that, or he wanted to\nkeep an eye on us.": "",
  "Hope not. I don't need that guy\nbreathin' down our necks.": "",
  "I don't need that guy\nbreathin' down our necks.": "",
  "Anyway, you wanna head home?": "",
  "Anyway, you figure it's time\nto head home?": "",
  "Not yet. Something's bugging me\nabout the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "Whaddya mean?": "",
  "Huh? Whaddya mean?": "",
  "'Til today, I just thought they were here\nscouting out some new turf in Kamurocho.": "",
  "But it turns out they've got a construction conglomerate\nbehind them, and they're involved in redevelopment, too.": "",
  "But, turns out they've got a construction conglomerate\nbehind them, and redevelopment plans too.": "",
  "So you wanna figure out who\nthe \"real\" Kyorei is.": "",
  "So you wanna figure out\nwhat the \"real\" Kyorei Clan's about.": "",
  "Not a bad idea...\nBut how're we gonna investigate 'em?": "",
  "You don't remember?\nWe have a friend on the inside.": "",
  "Remember? We have a friend\non the inside.": "",
  "You mean Murase?": "",
  "...Murase, you mean?": "",
  "Oh yeah.\nC'mon, let's head to KJ Art.": "",
  "Murase's our guy. To KJ Art?": "",
  "Hey Tak, we're getting close to KJ Art.": "",
  "Tak. KJ Art's just over there.": "",
  "You wanna bust out the drone?\nSee what our old friend Murase's up to?": "",
  "So, then. Wanna bust out the drone?\nSee what our old friend Murase's up to?": "",
  "Yeah, should be pretty easy\nto find him this time.": "",
  "Yeah. And we know the best view\nof the KJ Art building.": "",
  "Heh. Right this way.": "",
  "Heh.\nRight this way.": "",
  "All right, it's spy time.": "",
  "Okay, I'll handle the flying.\nYou keep watch on anyone coming in or out.": "",
  "Okay, I'll handle the pigeon.\nKaito-san, watch the doors.": "",
  "Guys... What the hell were you\nthinking coming here?": "",
  "Ugh, come on...\nWhat the hell are you all thinking?": "",
  "What, you don't want us around?": "",
  "What, you don't want us here?": "",
  "No it's just...\nIf Captain Hamura saw you here, he'd...": "",
  "You know this shit's dangerous.\nIf the captain saw you here...": "",
  "How's he gonna find us if he's off the grid?\nWhat are you worried about?": "",
  "Captain Hamura's hidin' like the rat he is.\nWe'll be fine.": "",
  "Yeah, but... Forget it.\nWho's your friend?": "",
  "Yeah, but still...\nAnd who's your friend?": "",
  "I'm Sugiura.\nFumiya Sugiura.": "",
  "This isn't the first time\nSugiura here's saved my neck.": "",
  "We've met before. Sugiura's helped me\nout of some tight spots.": "",
  "That mask...": "",
  "Ain't that the symbol of some\nbig time burglary ring?": "",
  "I know there's some masked burglary ring\nin Kamurocho. You one of their boys?": "",
  "It is... but I bailed on that.\nI'm flying solo now.": "",
  "Used to be, but not anymore.\nI run solo now.": "",
  "What were you doing\nover by KJ Art?": "",
  "What I'd like to know is...\nWhy were you around KJ Art?": "",
  "Don't wanna talk?": "",
  "No, I just... don't know where to start.\nIt's kinda complicated.": "",
  "No... I just don't know where to start.\nIt's kinda complicated.": "",
  "Okay, well. I used to work for the Kajihira Group.\nDown at their headquarters in Kansai.": "",
  "Well... I used to work for the Kajihira Group.\nDown at their headquarters in Kansai.": "",
  "You mean the guys backing the Kyorei Clan?": "",
  "Kajihira? You mean the guys\nbacking the Kyorei Clan?": "",
  "Yeah. I had a job doing IT work\nfor them for a bit.": "",
  "Yeah.\nI did some IT work for them.": "",
  "Keeping their servers safe, that kinda stuff.\nI was their systems engineer.": "",
  "Keeping their servers safe, that kinda stuff.\nI was practically their systems engineer.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(An ex-Kajihira guy turned criminal, huh?)</color>": "",
  "Well, one day I noticed some accounting\ndata was off. They were cooking the books.": "",
  "Well... One day, I noticed someone had been\ntampering with accounting numbers.": "",
  "Tampering?": "",
  "It turns out the top guys\nwere making a slush fund.": "",
  "Turns out the top guys of the group\nwere making a slush fund.": "",
  "They stashed away millions, writing it all off\nas some vague business expense.": "",
  "They stashed millions, citing it as some\nvague business expense.": "",
  "Digging it all up was kind of a thrill...\nUntil I got caught.": "",
  "Man, digging into it was such a thrill...\nuntil I got caught, at least.": "",
  "Everything happened\nso fast after that.": "",
  "Everything happened so fast\nafter that.": "",
  "They accused me of embezzling company funds\nand threw me out on the street.": "",
  "They accused me of embezzling company funds\nand threw me out.": "",
  "Nobody would believe a word I said.": "",
  "But I knew where the money was going.\nA group of yakuza known as the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "But I knew where the money was going.\nFunneled to a clan of yakuza known as the Kyorei.": "",
  "Specifically, a shell company called KJ Art.": "",
  "Specifically, a shell company called KJ Art.\nIf I could prove everything I found out...": "",
  "If I could just prove it, I'd be able to\nget back at the bastards who cheated me.": "",
  "I'd get revenge on the bastards\nwho cheated me.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So, Sugiura's got a grudge against the Kajihira Group...)</color>": "",
  "Which is why you were\nstaking out the place.": "",
  "I've been keeping watch\nover there for a while now.": "",
  "I've been keeping watch over there\nfor a while now.": "",
  "I even saw you break in\nand beat the crap outta Murase.": "",
  "I even saw you when you broke in\nand beat the crap outta Murase.": "",
  "Assuming all that's true,\nwhy did you rescue us?": "",
  "Still, that doesn't explain\nwhy you rescued us.": "",
  "Remember when you asked\nto team up, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san... Weren't you the one who\nsaid we should work together?": "",
  "I thought about it...\nand it seems like a pretty good deal.": "",
  "Well, I've decided that\nsounds like a good deal.": "",
  "Might be worth putting our heads together\nfor a while. Me and the Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Might be worth putting our heads together.\nYagami Detective Agency is the real deal.": "",
  "Especially you, Kaito-san.": "",
  "No matter how many yakuza come to take you down,\nyou always have it handled. It's incredible.": "",
  "No matter how many yakuza come at you,\nyou always have it handled. It's incredible.": "",
  "What can I say.\nYou got a good eye, kid.": "",
  "Hey, you've got a good eye\nfor a kid your age, huh?": "",
  "Don't let it go to your head.": "",
  "Don't let it get to your head.": "",
  "Hey, can you guys please take this shit elsewhere?": "",
  "Hey. If you're gonna discuss this,\n<font_kind=yakuza_italic>please</font_kind> take it somewhere else.": "",
  "So, whaddya say?": "",
  "I'm not saying we've gotta become best buddies,\nbut we can at least give each other a hand.": "",
  "I dunno if we'll ever be friends or anything,\nbut we can at least give each other a hand.": "",
  "How?": "",
  "You want your Mole.\nI want the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "We might not be after the same thing,\nbut there's a lot of overlap.": "",
  "How can I get in touch with you?": "",
  "Will that work?": "",
  "That'll work, right?": "",
  "How the hell'd you do that?": "",
  "Where'd you get my number?": "",
  "I took your phone, remember?\nNot like I had to hack it or anything.": "",
  "I took your phone, remember?\nWasn't that hard to check it on the run.": "",
  "Kids these days...": "",
  "What's his deal...?": "",
  "Y'know, I kinda like this Sugiura kid.": "",
  "Sugiura-kun seems like\na pretty good kid.": "",
  "That little compliment\nreally won you over huh?": "",
  "All it takes is one compliment, huh?": "",
  "It's not like I fully trust him yet, man.": "",
  "Not saying I trust him yet.": "",
  "We scratch his back, he scratches ours.\nAs long as that's all he wants, I'm good.": "",
  "We scratch his back, he scratches ours.\nThat seems fair enough.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Like what?": "เช่นอะไรล่ะ?",
  "Yeah, guess so.": "เออ ดูเหมือนจะงั้น",
  "Whaddya mean?": "หมายความว่าไง?",
  "Huh? Whaddya mean?": "หา? หมายความว่ายังไงคะ?",
  "So, whaddya say?": "เอาไง ว่าไงล่ะ?",
  "How?": "ยังไง?",
  "Kids these days...": "เด็กสมัยนี้..."
 }
}
